# Final KDE Frameworks 5 (5.116) builds for MSYS2 UCRT64. They are no longer in
# the MSYS2 package database, but repo.msys2.org still serves the files. CI
# downloads these exact files, checks the SHA-256 sums and installs them with
# pacman -U; pacman takes the other dependencies (Qt 5.15, gettext, ...) from
# the live repository. Regenerate with dev/windows/kf5-closure.py.
